---
import WhatsAppIcon from "../svg/WhatsAppIcon.astro"
import FacebookIcon from "../svg/FacebookIcon.astro"
import InstagramIcon from "../svg/InstagramIcon.astro"
import YoutubeIcon from "../svg/YoutubeIcon.astro"
import TiktokIcon from "../svg/TiktokIcon.astro"
import CamLogo from "../svg/CamLogo.astro"
import PinIcon from "../svg/PinIcon.astro"
import MapIcon from "../svg/MapIcon.astro"
import ScheduleIcon from "../svg/ScheduleIcon.astro"
import ClockIcon from "../svg/ClockIcon.astro"
import EmailSymbolIcon from "../svg/EmailSymbolIcon.astro"

---

<div class="bg-purple-dark">
    <footer class="footer section-space f-purple-light w-page m-auto">
        <div class="flex space-between">
            <div class="flex align-items">
                <CamLogo color="--hue-purple-light"/>
            </div>
            <ul class="social-icons flex flex-gap-lg align-items">
                <li><a href="#"><WhatsAppIcon color="--hue-purple-light" size={24} /></a></li>
                <li><a href="#"><FacebookIcon color="--hue-purple-light" /></a></li>
                <li><a href="#"><InstagramIcon color="--hue-purple-light" /></a></li>
                <li><a href="#"><YoutubeIcon color="--hue-purple-light" /></a></li>
                <li><a href="#"><TiktokIcon color="--hue-purple-light" /></a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    
        <p class="l-15 w-half m-block-x3">Contamos con más de 15 años de experiencia brindando cursos personalizados de Clases de Apoyo, Medicina e Idiomas. Te preparamos con profesionales altamente capacitados para acompañar tu carrera y rendir los exámenes de la facultad de medicina en todas las materias.</p>
    
        <div class="m-block-x3">
            <h4 class="subtitle medium">Centro Evaluador Dele & Aplicador Siele y Cele</h4>
            <div class="images flex flex-gap flex-align">
                <img class="dele" src="logos/dele_LOGO_white.webp" alt="">
                <img class="siele" src="logos/siele_LOGO_white.webp" alt="">
                <img class="cele" src="logos/cele_LOGO_white.webp" alt="">
            </div>
        </div>
    
        <div class="flex flex-col flex-gap-lg">
            <div class="flex flex-col flex-gap">
                <h4 class="subtitle medium">Sede Lagos</h4>
                <address class="flex align-items flex-gap">
                    <PinIcon color="--hue-purple" /> Ovidio Lagos 640
                </address>
                <address class="flex align-items flex-gap">
                    <MapIcon color="--hue-purple" /> Rosario, Santa Fe
                </address>
            </div>
        
            <div class="flex flex-col flex-gap">
                <h4 class="subtitle medium">Horarios</h4>
                <em class="flex align-items flex-gap">
                    <ScheduleIcon color="--hue-purple" /> Lunes - Viernes
                </em>
                <em class="flex align-items flex-gap">
                    <ClockIcon color="--hue-purple" lineColor="--hue-purple-dark"/> 9:00h a 16:00h
                </em>
            </div>
        
            <div class="flex flex-col flex-gap">
                <h4 class="subtitle medium">Contactos</h4>
                <em class="flex align-items flex-gap">
                    <WhatsAppIcon color="--hue-purple" size={18}/>
                    +54 9 341 216-6867
                </em>
                <em class="flex align-items flex-gap">
                    Atenção para ingressantes em português
                </em>
                <em class="flex align-items flex-gap">
                    <WhatsAppIcon color="--hue-purple" size={18}/>
                    +54 9 341 546-9738
                </em>
                <em class="flex align-items flex-gap">
                    <EmailSymbolIcon color="--hue-purple" size={18}/>
                    contacto@caminstituto.com
                </em>
            </div>
        </div>
    
    </footer>
</div>

<style>
    .footer {
        background-color: var(--hue-purple-dark);
    }
    .section-space {
        padding-block: var(--section-vertical-space);
        padding-inline: var(--section-horizontal-space);
    }

    .subtitle {
        font-size: var(--subtitle);
    }
    .medium {
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    ul {
        padding: 0;
    }
    ul li {
        list-style: none;
        margin: 0;
    }
    .l-15 {
        line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .w-half {
        max-width: 60ch;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .flex {
        display: flex;
    }
    .flex-col {
        flex-direction: column;
    }
    .flex-gap-lg {
        gap: calc(var(--gap-space-lg) * 1.5);
    }
    .flex-gap {
        gap: var(--gap-space);
    }
    .flex-gap-s {
        gap: var(--gap-space-s);
    }
    .align-items {
        align-items: center;
    }
    .space-between {
        justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .m-block-x3 {
        margin-block: calc(var(--gap-space-lg) * 3);
    }

    .f-white {
        color: var(--hue-white);
    }
    .f-purple-light {
        color: var(--hue-purple-light);
    }

    .w-full {
        max-width: 600px;
        width: 100%;
    }
    .bg-purple-dark {
        background-color: var(--hue-purple-dark);
    }

    .images img {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
    }
    .dele {
        max-width: 5rem;
    }
    .siele {
        max-width: 8rem;
    }
    .cele {
        max-width: 6.5rem;
    }
    .flex-align {
        align-items: center;
    }
</style>